'''Roots''' are aggressive [[creatures]] spawned by [[The Elder]] or found in [[Black Forest#Alternative biomes|Root Black Forest]]  alternative biome.

They are enlarged, vicious tree roots that flail around frantically in an attempt to damage their target.

